  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Users on the beta client are randomly showing as offline despite being online. They would just randomly show as offline, then show as online a few minutes later, then back to offline.\n\nIt was happening for a lot of people at the recent community meetup. \n\nHere's a screenshot showing it, MY_MAN is shown as being offline in the menu despite being in front of me. He was offline in the menu and the website.\n\n(It also wasn't just MY_MAN, basically everyone on the beta at the meetup was randomly showing as offline)\n\nUsers on Live don't randomly go offline, but still see Beta users as offline.",
